        "original_id": "331dc649-546c-5636-9489-f42ca6938033",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2011 Super Copa Telcel, 2011 LATAM Challenge Series, 2005 FIA WTCC Race of Spain\n- Products: SEAT León\n- Companies: SEAT\n- People: Jordi Gené\n\nFacts:\n- SEAT began building the SEAT León, a hatchback small family car, in October 1998.\n- At the 2005 FIA WTCC Race of Spain, Jordi Gené won the first race for SEAT.\n- At the 2005 FIA WTCC Race of Spain, the win was SEAT's third win and the first WTCC win for the new SEAT León.\n- The 2011 Super Copa Telcel was the inaugural season of the Super Copa Telcel.\n- In the 2011 Super Copa Telcel, the SEAT León was the car of the category.\n- A participant in the 2011 LATAM Challenge Series also competed in Super Copa Telcel.",
